  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Migrants-Centered Policies, Frameworks, and Evidence Based-Operations in Response to Climate Change Impacts on Human Mobility in Arab States in Western Mediterranean and Wider Arab Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to improving the policies, cooperation frameworks and evidence-based operations to integrate human mobility considerations into climate action and to strengthen the protection of vulnerable migrants in the Arab states in Western Mediterranean and wider Arab region.</narrative>
  </description>
